| Command | Who |
|---|---|
| `/slipway:plan <% derived.env %> --layer app --image-tag <tag>` | anyone; read-only |
| `/slipway:deploy <tag> <% derived.env %>` | triggers `cd.yml`: plan job, then apply behind the `<% github.cd_environment %>` environment approval |

Never apply this layer from a laptop: the guard hook blocks it and the state key (`<% project.name %>/app/<% derived.env %>.tfstate`) is written by the CD identity.
